text:
I Made AI Make AI Image Gen Model

I put ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Composer 2, and more models to a challenge to make an AI Image Gen Model (DDPM) from scratch.

The AI models I used were: ChatGPT 5.5, Claude Opus 4.7, Sonnet 4.6, Kimi K2.5, Grok and Composer 2.

Timestamps:
00:00 - Intro
00:12 - Creating prompt
01:23 - Making AI Image Gen (DDPM) with AI
10:12 - Result: 9 AIs Make AI Code Editor

